## What is Zettelkasten?
- way of taking down small notes written in your own words (**Zettels**) and linking them together.
 
---
## How to take notes? 
- #### Literature Notes 
	- Simple , to the point short notes
	- Use own words
	- One idea per note
- #### Reference Notes
	- Write down a brief and link it to the reference
- #### Permanent Notes (Zettels)
	- **Keep it simple**
	- Explain one topic in a crystal clear manner
	- Connect new and existing notes
	- Use a single template
	- Use Tags
	- Reference to literature notes

